  "content": "\n\n<p>修改掉落物品與方塊的外觀。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.soundsofthesun.net%252fprojects%252fitem-drops%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://translate.soundsofthesun.net/widget/item-drops/status-badge.png\" alt=\"翻譯狀態\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FvCNWcm8/images/a715055c508afdbfa2f1fcc63434113be51bbdde.webp\" alt=\"示範圖片\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FvCNWcm8/images/faac8cb2dc73b61f25c860cfe45d70a3b3117fcd.webp\" alt=\"設定選項圖片\"></p>\n<h3>問題回報</h3>\n<p>您可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/SoundsoftheSun/item-drops/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fSoundsoftheSun%252fItem-Drops%252fissues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Codeberg</a> 上提交問題回報。</p>\n<h3>翻譯</h3>\n<p>我的模組下載用戶大多來自非英語為主要語言的國家！如果您想協助將我的任何模組翻譯成您的語言，可以前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.soundsofthesun.net%252fprojects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://translate.soundsofthesun.net/projects</a> 並使用 GitHub 帳號登入來貢獻翻譯！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.soundsofthesun.net%252fprojects%252fitem-drops%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://translate.soundsofthesun.net/widget/item-drops/multi-auto.svg\" alt=\"翻譯狀態\"></a></p>\n<p>翻譯貢獻者：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>語言</th>\n<th>貢獻者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>簡體中文</td>\n<td>LinLei_Baruch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阿拉伯文</td>\n<td>Amir</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>更多翻譯歷史紀錄可於原始碼存放庫的 i18n 分支中查看。</p>",
